WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.950
- Before we say goodbye

00:00:00.950 --> 00:00:02.860
we like to play a quick round of

00:00:02.860 --> 00:00:04.121
- Drewth or Dare.

00:00:04.121 --> 00:00:07.210
(audience applauds)

00:00:07.210 --> 00:00:09.430
All right, we have Sean Bunch.

00:00:09.430 --> 00:00:10.820
Hi Sean.
- Hi.

00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:12.350
Hi Drew. Hi Ross.

00:00:12.350 --> 00:00:13.183
How y'all doing?

00:00:13.183 --> 00:00:14.016
- [Drew] I love your name.

00:00:14.016 --> 00:00:15.070
- Oh, thank you.
- Sean Bunch.

00:00:15.070 --> 00:00:17.630
- My mother gave it to me.
(Ross laughs)

00:00:17.630 --> 00:00:22.030
So I and my boyfriend are a big
fan of yours on "Drag Race".

00:00:22.030 --> 00:00:23.280
- Oh, thank, you're talking to me.

00:00:23.280 --> 00:00:25.124
Thank you.
- I am, so...

00:00:25.124 --> 00:00:26.740
(audience applauds)
- I am too.

00:00:26.740 --> 00:00:28.980
You know, it's my daughter
Olive's favorite show.

00:00:28.980 --> 00:00:30.290
- It is.
- Oh, she loves it.

00:00:30.290 --> 00:00:31.690
Oh, we all love it at our house.

00:00:31.690 --> 00:00:33.850
- I love it too, I can't
believe I get to do it.

00:00:33.850 --> 00:00:36.220
- Well, I have a Drewth for both of you.

00:00:36.220 --> 00:00:37.053
- [Ross] Okay.

00:00:37.053 --> 00:00:39.010
- So, my Drewth today is

00:00:39.010 --> 00:00:41.940
what would both of your drag names be?

00:00:41.940 --> 00:00:42.773
- Oh.
- Oh.

00:00:42.773 --> 00:00:44.450
- Do we get judged on our drag names,

00:00:44.450 --> 00:00:46.223
the way we get judged on our pet names?

00:00:46.223 --> 00:00:47.170
(Ross laughs)
- Not today.

00:00:47.170 --> 00:00:48.530
- Okay.

00:00:48.530 --> 00:00:49.880
- Oh, you know, people ask me that,

00:00:49.880 --> 00:00:51.650
I never have a good answer for that.

00:00:51.650 --> 00:00:54.870
I've never, I've actually
never done drag before.

00:00:54.870 --> 00:00:55.703
Yet.

00:00:56.920 --> 00:00:58.880
Could I just go with Nellie?

00:00:58.880 --> 00:01:01.800
- I mean, you could go with
Nellie, but I mean, uh...

00:01:01.800 --> 00:01:02.830
- [Ross] Do you have one for me?

00:01:02.830 --> 00:01:03.663
A better one?
- I mean,

00:01:03.663 --> 00:01:07.911
what about Rossay Alday?

00:01:07.911 --> 00:01:09.180
(audience coos)

00:01:09.180 --> 00:01:12.748
Or how about Farrah Rossett?

00:01:12.748 --> 00:01:14.452
(Drew and audience gasp in awe)

00:01:14.452 --> 00:01:16.400
(audience applauds)

00:01:16.400 --> 00:01:17.600
- [Ross] Farrah Rossett.

00:01:19.182 --> 00:01:20.240
- I mean...
- That's so good.

00:01:20.240 --> 00:01:22.292
- I was like, Mm-hm, mm-hm,

00:01:22.292 --> 00:01:23.880
Mm-hm!
- There we go.

00:01:23.880 --> 00:01:24.942
- Farrah Rossett.

00:01:24.942 --> 00:01:26.660
- And how about for you Drew?

00:01:26.660 --> 00:01:28.389
- Motley Drew.

00:01:28.389 --> 00:01:29.810
- Oh.
(Ross claps)

00:01:29.810 --> 00:01:31.470
- I mean, I am rebellious.

00:01:31.470 --> 00:01:32.303
- Yeah.

00:01:33.470 --> 00:01:34.570
What about you, Sean Bunch?

00:01:34.570 --> 00:01:35.403
You got one for you?

00:01:35.403 --> 00:01:36.540
- Yeah.
- Oh, yeah.

00:01:36.540 --> 00:01:38.773
Well I'm Miss Ruby Troutman.

00:01:40.714 --> 00:01:42.315
- (laughs) Shantay, you stay,

00:01:42.315 --> 00:01:43.894
I really like that.
- Oh, yeah.

00:01:43.894 --> 00:01:45.269
(audience applauds)
It was the most beautiful day.

00:01:45.269 --> 00:01:46.539
- Well done, well done.

00:01:46.539 --> 00:01:49.122
(bright music)

